              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga babaandu bakucha ne khusalanila khu sibala, basaala bakhaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaana ba Wele babona bakhaana be babaandu khuuba ne lukoondo lulayi, mala beroborelamo bakhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Kumwoyo kwase se kulafukiilila babaandu bamenye mindali na mindali tawe, sikila bali be khufwa, khwako balamenya kimiiko emia ndala ne kamakhumi kabili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 13.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu ndaalo echo, lundi aakhaba enyuma wacho, Banariiria baaba khu sibala. Nibo babaana ba Wele basaala mu bakhaana be babaandu. Bano baaba babaandu be kamaani ne fuma engali mu bise bie khaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
